#: site/index.njk:89
msgid ""
"Recovery requires both a recovery key you keep separately and an exported "
"encrypted recovery bundle. The reference client can export encrypted "
"recovery bundles; the mobile recovery interface isn’t built yet. Habibi’s "
"operator won’t hold your vault key or recover your content for you. If you "
"lose every device and either your recovery key or the encrypted bundle is "
"unavailable, the operator cannot recover your content."
msgstr ""

